id: ruler
name: Ruler
order: 15
description: >
  A good leader knows when to delegate, and a good subordinate knows the price of failing you.
text: >
  Ruler: A good leader knows when to delegate, and a good subordinate knows the price of failing you.
  (1)-[Passive]: There is no limit to the number of Minions you may possess, but only up to 10 of your Minions may be in a Combat Encounter at any one time (Defeated Minions do not count towards this limit).
  (2)-[Triggered]: If one of your Minions hits an Opponent and deals Damage, gain a stack of Overwhelm.
  (3)-[Triggered/Power, 1/Round]: Spend 2 stacks of Overwhelm to target all Allies within a Large Sphere AoE (centered on you). Increase the Soak Value and Combat Rolls of those Allies by 1(T) until the start of your next turn.

---

# (1) No limit on your Minions; 10 not Defeated in a Combat Encounter (maneuvers.mjs minionCaps, combat.mjs).
[passive]
allow minions.ruler;

# (2) One of your Minions dealt an Opponent Damage with an Attacking Maneuver (minion-damage). Automatic by default, its Triggered/Automatic
# button.
[triggered/minion-damage, effect 2]
overwhelm.stacks += 1;

# (3) The Power Up Maneuver used, 2 stacks of Overwhelm held: offered in a window then and there (chat.mjs answerPower).
# Who is within the Sphere ticked, the stacks spent, and each of them Ruled - 1(T), your Tier - until the start of your
# next turn (chat.mjs rulerAllies).
[triggered/power, 1/round, effect 3]
requires stacksAtLeast(2, "overwhelm");
rulerAllies();
